{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 Q\tab 1. Quote John, chapter 1, verse 1.\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. "In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God." (John 1:1)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 A\tab 2. According to John, chapter 1, verse 1, who was with God?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. The Word (John 1:1)\par}
{\pard\par}
