{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. The Word (John 1:1)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 G\tab 4. Who was in the beginning?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. The Word (Jesus) (John 1:1)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 G\tab 5. When was the Word?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. In the beginning (John 1:1)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 X\tab 6. Who was with God in the beginning?\par}
