{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 A\tab 8. According to John, chapter 1, verse 2, with whom was he in the beginning?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. God (John 1:2)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 G\tab 9. When was the Word with God?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. In the beginning (John 1:2)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 A\tab 10. According to John, chapter 1, verse 2, when was he with God?\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. In the beginning (John 1:2)\par}
{\pard\par}
